  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Who answers a request",
      "items": [
        "Unlisted route: API Gateway returns 404 {\"message\":\"Not Found\"}; Lambda never runs.",
        "Over 10 rps (burst 20): API Gateway returns 429 before invoking.",
        "Listed route: the handler returns 200, 400 (bad limit or cursor), 404 (user not found) or 500 (AWS error, details only in logs)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Least privilege",
      "items": [
        "Who may CALL the function: the Lambda permission, principal apigateway.amazonaws.com, source_arn = this API's execution_arn/*/*.",
        "What the function may DO: write its logs, and run dynamodb:GetItem and dynamodb:Scan on this one table ARN. No writes or deletes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Build, deploy, release",
      "items": [
        "terraform/bootstrap (local state) runs once and creates the S3 state bucket via modules/state-bucket.",
        "No build step: every plan zips app/handler.py, and boto3 comes from the Lambda runtime.",
        "The first apply creates 19 resources, including 5 seed users. A code change updates only source_code_hash."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Scope of this drawing",
      "items": [
        "Drawn from the lesson12-13 Terraform and Python source, and confirmed by a live deploy; not a live AWS inventory.",
        "TABLE_NAME reaches the function as an environment variable from the table module output."
      ]
    }
  ]
